              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "On weekdays, I wake up at 6:30, but I don't get up until 6:45. I put on my running shoes and head out for a quick run. I get to work at 8:30 and log in. I usually knock off at 5:30 and get back home by 6:30. In the evening, I wind down with a book, but sometimes I stay up too late watching series and doze off on the couch. On Saturdays, I sleep in!",
